<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-5b6d214 elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="5b6d214" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-320d114 elementor-hidden-mobile" data-id="320d114" data-element_type="column">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5804925 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-page-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5804925" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-page-title.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Marina Korinthos &#8211; Greece &#8211; Peloponnese</h2> </div>
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5cbc3cc elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5cbc3cc" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>Marina Korinthos is situated in the famous city of Corinth, a city founded in antiquity and seat of ancient Greek and Roman civilizations.</p>
<p>The marina currently has 4 berths to rent for transient yachts and vessels with the rest of the harbour given over primarily to merchant and commercial shipping.</p>
<p>There are plans in motion to construct pontoons and piers to accommodate up to 300 boats 20 metres in length. There are shipyard facilities on site which include, crane, boat ramp, marine workshops, divers and boat ramp. Seamanship courses and car rental is available as well as sanitary facilities and weather forecasting. The city of Corinth is within walking distance and has countless more amenities. The marina is in a good location for exploring this particular region of Greece with many interesting archaeological sites within a few hours drive.</p>
</div>
</div>
